title = "Permanent Progression"
message = "Completing games and achievements permanently unlocks content on your profile. An unlock makes that item eligible for future shops.

Lastly, between Mall Zones, you'll only be able to carry over a limited number of items-- POGs, Money, etc.

There are other suprises for you to discover on the way.  Have fun, and behave."
